BraleModule_Constructor
├── when paymentRails is zero address
│   └── it should revert with BraleModule_ZeroPaymentRails
├── when owner is zero address
│   └── it should revert with OwnableInvalidOwner
└── when params are valid
    ├── it should set paymentRails
    ├── it should set the owner
    └── it should start redemptionNonce at zero
